cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pPreProc or the PFB/PFC reader, please cite this software and the associated article."
type: software
title: "pPreProc: mass-spectrometry data preprocessing and indexed PFB/PFC access"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-21
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/crf-pfind/pPreProc"
url: "https://github.com/crf-pfind/pPreProc"
authors:
