abstract: >-
  pPreProc is a unified mass-spectrometry data-preprocessing framework. This
  repository provides the versioned specification and Python and C++ reference
  readers for its indexed PFB/PFC representation. The compiled Windows
  preprocessing runtime is distributed as a separately qualified release asset.
keywords:
  - proteomics
  - mass spectrometry
  - preprocessing
  - PFB
  - PFC
